# Title: CLR DLL Loaded Via Office Applications
# ID: d13c43f0-f66b-4279-8b2c-5912077c1780
# Status: test
# Level: medium
# Author: Antonlovesdnb
# Date: 2020-02-19
# Tags: attack.execution, attack.t1204.002
# Description: Detects CLR DLL being loaded by an Office Product
# Converted by: Sigma Universal SIEM/EDR CLI

index=* eventtype=wineventlog ((process_path="*\\excel.exe" OR process_path="*\\mspub.exe" OR process_path="*\\outlook.exe" OR process_path="*\\onenote.exe" OR process_path="*\\onenoteim.exe" OR process_path="*\\powerpnt.exe" OR process_path="*\\winword.exe") AND ImageLoaded="*\\clr.dll*")
